<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rhone-Poulenc cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rhone-Poulenc cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Robert Uhl said he downgraded Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said he cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $3.60 a share from $3.85 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Rhone-Poulenc Rorer dropped 3-3/4 to 68-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Rhone-Poulenc is a majority-owned by the French chemical company Rhone-Poulenc SA.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
